							],
							"provides": [
								"apugli"
							]
						}
					],
					"content": {
						"names": {
							"item": [
								"4 coal OR 4 feathers create:\nBasic Kami\n\n4 nether quartz OR 4 glowing inc sacks create:\nIntermediate Kami\n\n4 amethyst shards OR 4 phantom membranes create:\nComplex Kami",
								"A not-so- comprehensive enchanting guide that unveils the art of transmutating humble ingredients to forge extraordinary, sentient tools.\n\nLets begin!",
								"Artistic Animacy",
								"Chaotic Kami:",
								"Chōchin",
								"EX-Fukuro",
								"Embrace the unpredictability of life as a beginner in the craft. With just these simple ingredients, all order gives way to complete randomness. Welcome to the realm of chaos!",
								"Fuku no kami mask",
								"Fukuro",
								"Karakasa",
								"Kitsune mask",
								"This item is a part of your being,",
								"Uba mask",
								"Welcome to Artistic Animacy!",
								"a cheery forgotten Karakasa",
								"in any external inventories.",
								"you cannot drop it or store it"
							]
						},
						"data": [
							"advancement",
							"loot_table"
						],
						"shaders": false
					}
				}
			]
		},
